        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "feat(ui): redesign chat composer controls",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- redesign the Control UI chat composer around a compact 48rem desktop maximum that shrinks continuously into mobile\n- integrate attachment, settings, model, context, camera, voice, stop, and send controls without shifting the text area\n- add a provider-aware model picker with logos, staged Save/Discard changes, reasoning slider, speed controls, and configured catalog preservation\n- align sender/agent bubbles and metadata while fixing five-line input growth, token estimates, response following, stale run activity, dismissible errors, realtime voice draft leakage, and timestamp-hover layout reflow\n- clear the previous CI failures in production types, test types, lint, and generated docs\n\n## Behavioral proof\n\nCaptured from current `upstream/main` and the PR's current visual implementation with the repository E2E Gateway fixture. The fixture includes a 200k context window with 38k tokens used, so the 19% context wheel is visible in the refreshed screenshots. The final head adds test timing, locale output, and current-main merges without changing this rendered layout.\n\n### Before: current `upstream/main`\n\n<img width=\"1366\" height=\"768\" alt=\"Current main desktop chat composer before the redesign\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6f1ac946-1863-4908-adcb-72a33328dcb9\" />\n\n#### Before interaction\n\n<img width=\"900\" height=\"506\" alt=\"Current main desktop composer interaction before the redesign\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/38ce2599-14d9-4b0e-ab95-246308d9ab17\" />\n\n### After: current PR visual state\n\n#### Desktop composer\n\n<img width=\"1366\" height=\"768\" alt=\"Redesigned desktop composer with model controls and 19 percent context wheel\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6e274fd6-4a70-414d-bf81-fdf78e4e7a22\" />\n\n#### Mobile composer\n\n<img width=\"393\" height=\"852\" alt=\"Responsive mobile composer with camera voice controls and 19 percent context wheel\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3b5cd5ae-179c-427b-afd9-04cab638311c\" />\n\n#### Provider and model picker\n\n<img width=\"1366\" height=\"768\" alt=\"Provider-aware model picker with staged model reasoning and speed controls\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/49d0eb03-ac17-4614-8b8c-ef24a37da727\" />\n\n#### Combined settings\n\n<img width=\"1366\" height=\"768\" alt=\"Combined chat and voice settings popover\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b83b0259-8e35-4e3b-9161-b026c0f1328f\" />\n\n#### Desktop interaction\n\n<img width=\"900\" height=\"506\" alt=\"Redesigned desktop composer interaction\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d2b6b36f-f291-423a-94b7-1301575db664\" />\n\n#### Mobile interaction\n\n<img width=\"240\" height=\"522\" alt=\"Redesigned mobile composer interaction\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aacf7aea-3140-4981-865d-aef441104288\" />\n\n#### Timestamp details without layout shift\n\n<img width=\"904\" height=\"1041\" alt=\"Live Rosita timestamp details rendered as an overlay without moving the conversation or composer\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/87108674-2849-47a6-a8bf-8c6a91280c64\" />\n\nThe timestamp regression was measured before and after the fix: opening message context previously increased the metadata/message group by about 59px; the anchored overlay now leaves the message and footer geometry unchanged.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs ui/src/pages/chat/chat-view.test.ts ui/src/lib/sessions/index.test.ts ui/src/pages/chat/chat-controls.test.ts ui/src/pages/chat/chat-composer.test.ts`\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs ui/src/pages/chat/chat-responsive.browser.test.ts ui/src/pages/chat/chat-composer-redesign.e2e.test.ts ui/src/pages/chat/browser-talk-start-stop.e2e.test.ts`\n- `node scripts/run-tsgo.mjs -p tsconfig.core.json --incremental --tsBuildInfoFile /tmp/pr100461-core-final-base.tsbuildinfo`\n- `node scripts/run-tsgo.mjs -p test/tsconfig/tsconfig.core.test.json --incremental --tsBuildInfoFile /tmp/pr100461-core-test-final-base.tsbuildinfo`\n- `pnpm lint`\n- `pnpm ui:i18n:check`\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs test/scripts/control-ui-i18n.test.ts test/scripts/package-acceptance-workflow.test.ts ui/src/pages/chat/chat-view.test.ts`\n- `pnpm docs:map:check`\n- `pnpm build:ci-artifacts`\n- targeted `oxfmt --check` for all PR-owned files\n- `git diff --check`\n- `$autoreview --mode branch --base upstream/main` (clean after the current-main merge, rejected-save rollback correction, locale completion, and timestamp overlay fix)\n- `$autoreview --mode local` (clean for the rejected-save timing correction; the only later local finding was unchanged current-main restart code and was excluded by the final branch review)\n\nThe full repository `pnpm format:check` currently reports the same unrelated formatting baseline failures on current `upstream/main`; every file owned by this PR passes targeted formatting.\n\nThe branch includes `upstream/main` at `e53131ea1c11921bbe2f966d2ca1760c41705c32`. Exact PR head: `8b14741f28fc61e629c6aa1a322070ccd8f5b6dd`.\n\n## Real behavior proof\n\nBehavior addressed: Control UI chat composer layout, provider/model selection, reasoning and speed controls, combined chat/voice settings, attachments, mobile camera capture, voice start/stop, send-state switching, context display, message alignment, timestamp details, run lifecycle state, error dismissal, response auto-scroll, and realtime voice draft handling.\n\nReal environment tested: Chromium at 1366x768 desktop and 393x852 mobile with the repository E2E Gateway fixture, plus the live Rosita Control UI for configured provider/model inventory and timestamp-overlay verification.\n\nExact steps or command run after this patch: Opened Chat, selected providers/models, staged and saved/discarded reasoning and speed changes, exercised rejected model saves, opened Settings, checked five-line overflow, started/stopped voice capture, verified microphone-to-send switching, opened mobile camera capture, streamed agent responses, and opened timestamp details while measuring message geometry.\n\nEvidence after fix: Fresh current-main/current-head screenshots and animated interaction captures above, focused unit/E2E/browser coverage, exact-head geometry measurements, and clean type/lint/docs/build gates.\n\nObserved result after fix: The composer remains centered at a 48rem maximum and shrinks continuously into mobile; context usage remains visible; provider catalogs and staged picker state stay consistent; failed model saves roll back; text growth caps at five lines; voice/camera/send controls switch correctly; completed runs clear activity; streamed responses follow the viewport; and timestamp details no longer reflow the conversation.\n\nWhat was not tested: Physical mobile camera hardware and a live external realtime voice provider; browser media and Gateway responses used deterministic fixtures.\n\n## Release note\n\nRedesigns the Control UI chat composer across desktop and mobile and fixes model-selection, run-state, scrolling, realtime voice, timestamp-hover, and CI regressions.\n",
